# Crazed Evil Santa, the December head (ticket 45): a flushed round face under a huge white beard with a snarl cut in it and bared teeth,
# a glowing red nose (emission), wide crazed eyes with tiny red irises under wild bushy white brows, a big curling moustache and a giant
# festive hat: a white fur band, a red cone as big as the head drooping back to one side and a white pompom.
# Frame (the soldier's head_top socket, ticket 43): the origin is the socket, 1.815 m over the soles; the head faces +Z, +Y is up. The
# size and the height come from the head part (content/parts/santa_head.sdf): normalized to the common size, the chin 4 cm lower than
# phase 1's (at 1.525 m, over the neck's top at 1.569 whose stub is inside it). The head turns on the Head bone, 0.25 m under the origin.
# The eyes are the small eye part monster_eye_santa, meshed once, used twice.
format 1

# No collider (the hit shape of the head is a number in the registry), and never culled before 200 m: the head is what reads at range
collider none
cull 200

Detail detail=0.592
    Part part=santa_head
